From: error-path <95665869+error-path@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:44:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(signals): removed safety code, concurrency and weakened
 tests

Three deterministic signals from AI code reviewers' checklists (research
R4-R6): change.safety_removed (log1p of deleted error-handling and guard
lines, net per hunk), change.concurrency (a changed line uses a
concurrency primitive) and tests.weakened (net assertion lines removed
or a skip marker added). Small positive priors until calibration fits
them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
